        "notes": "**Round 1**\n\n*Spynstem or Supercharger?*\n\nCheck who your DPS are, if they are heroes that can push in hard with you and get out like Mei, Reaper, or Soldier, aim to getting Supercharger as your first ability, they are not just usefull with your ult, but even with Mei you can use her wall to pin people with your javelin.\n\nIF THEY ARENT EITHER OF THEM, get Spynstem, its also good without them as it can massively help out in the first round, remember, this build isnt to go in as a solo carry, its to go in as a solo carry and still benefit your team with your ult buff.",
